{
  "name": "16 - SETUP - Scheduled Work Data",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Run this once\n\nSelect **Execute workflow** below. It creates two local tables:\n\n- `scheduled_runs` \u2014 one row per thing you have asked your agent to do on a schedule\n- `schedule_results` \u2014 what your agent said each time one of them ran\n\nNothing leaves your computer. Both start empty.\n\nRunning this again is safe and changes nothing.",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -660,
        -280
      ],
      "id": "95800000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Sticky Start Here"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Then publish the trigger\n\nCreating the tables is not enough. The workflow that actually watches the\nclock is **79 - TRIGGER - Scheduled work**, and it ships switched off so\nnothing starts running behind your back.\n\nOpen it, read the note on the canvas, and set the toggle at the top right\nto **Published**. Until you do, your agent will happily save a schedule\nand nothing will ever fire.\n\nThen just say it in the chat:\n\n> Every weekday at 8am, research mlai.au and tell me what changed.",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 5
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -200,
        -280
      ],
      "id": "95800000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Sticky Next Step"
    },
